        {
          "id": 716419045,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "In GitLab you can click on the commit link above (the \"811a80b8\" in \"The changes were merged into master with 811a80b8\"), and on that page select \"Options → Cherry Pick\".\n\nOn the command line you can do something like the following\n\n```\ngit checkout -b cherry-pick-811a80b8-3.6 origin/release-3.6\ngit cherry-pick -x 811a80b82732fe42e6ecec8b5d4ec65c6a1ed092\n```\n\nand push your MR.",
